1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,357
They said a delivery boy can't build an empire.

2
00:00:03,607 --> 00:00:07,848
Six months later — forty-seven stores, three cities.

3
00:00:08,098 --> 00:00:11,114
My first warehouse was a bicycle basket.

4
00:00:11,364 --> 00:00:14,428
Every rejection letter became my business plan.

5
00:00:14,678 --> 00:00:17,886
Now my brand ships to every port in America.

6
00:00:18,136 --> 00:00:21,032
The city that ignored me now wears my name.

7
00:00:21,282 --> 00:00:24,706
New York didn't change. I did.

8
00:00:24,956 --> 00:00:29,700
If I made it — so can you. Follow for Episode 2.
